# Review regression (D3: "10 s idle"). Before: the end box's 10 s counted from its opening, so
# it went back to the meeting under an open Tab menu, and the Enter meant to end the meeting
# then fell on the meeting page, silently: the meeting went on to the 3 h cap.
# Now: a box's time runs from its last key and waits while the menu is open over it; Enter on
# the meeting page says "In a meeting: Opt+R ends it".
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100 lang=zh
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 1500
press opt+r
wait 600
press enter
mic 3000 2500
press opt+r
wait 1000
press tab
wait 9500
shot menu-9s  the menu read 9.5 s over the end box: still End meeting?
press tab
wait 100
shot box  Tab: the end box is still there
press enter
wait 600
shot ended  Enter ends the meeting
press opt+r
wait 600
press enter
mic 2000 2500
press opt+r
wait 11000
shot back  the end box left alone 10 s: the meeting page again
press enter
wait 200
shot enter  Enter there: In a meeting: Opt+R ends it (never silent)
